# The runtime version being prepared. commaviewd-release (Actions > Run workflow) releases it as
# v<version>-alpha.<n>, then v<version>-beta, and after that beta moves on to the next patch by
# itself (scripts/release-version.mjs, which reads VERSION without its suffix); raise it only for
# a minor or major version. RELEASE_TAG is what a local bundle build is called.
VERSION="0.0.58-beta"
RELEASE_TAG="starpilot-c6-12-v0.0.58-beta"
